    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "summary": "Use Determine Mission when the next phase begins its first battle. At that point, resolve Acquire Relics, carry out Discard, deal with Fresh Supplies, and handle Test of Mettle. Auspicious Augury keeps its usual rules. The companion suggests seeking out a player who belongs to another Alliance for it.",
